%% SM-01 Scholarship Application state machine
%% Transition table: ScholarshipApplicationWorkflowService::TRANSITIONS (verbatim)
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> draft : student starts application

    draft --> submitted : student submits (submitApplication)

    submitted --> under_review : admin begins review
    under_review --> document_verification : admin requests document verification
    under_review --> rejected : admin rejects (remarks required)
    document_verification --> approved : approve — ALL required documents verified
    document_verification --> rejected : admin rejects (remarks required)

    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]

    note right of document_verification
        Guard: checkApprovalReadiness()
        Every required requirement must have a
        document with verification_status = verified.
        Otherwise the transition is refused.
    end note

    note left of draft
        Documents may be uploaded or deleted
        only in draft (allowsDocumentUpload()).
        draft is created on "Apply" and never
        re-entered once submitted.
    end note
